complete Separation Anxiety | Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Bones, in the piles of skulls and bones in the Vilebranch camps.
complete Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions [optional] | Vile Priestess Hexx and her Aman'zasi Guards at the temple south of the troll camps.
complete Lard Lost His Lunch | The Wildhammer camp by the coast.
complete Cannibalistic Cousins | Vilebranch Scalpers.
complete Message to the Wildhammer | Highvale area Wildhammer.
